        "title": {
          "en": "OpenAI to Adopt Robots.txt Signal for AI Training Preferences",
          "zh": "OpenAI将采纳robots.txt信号管理网站AI训练偏好"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI announced it will respect a shared robots.txt signal, enabling website operators to convey their AI training data preferences to participating AI providers.",
          "zh": "OpenAI宣布将遵循共享的robots.txt信号，使网站运营者能够向参与的AI提供商表达其AI训练数据偏好。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "OpenAI will implement support for a robots.txt signal.",
            "This robots.txt signal is designed to be shared among participating AI providers.",
            "Its function is to allow website operators to express their AI training data preferences."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "OpenAI将实施对robots.txt信号的支持。",
            "此robots.txt信号旨在在参与的AI提供商之间共享。",
            "其功能是允许网站运营者表达其AI训练数据偏好。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This move establishes a standardized mechanism for data governance in AI training, potentially influencing broader industry practices regarding intellectual property and data usage. It provides website operators with a clearer method to manage how their content is used by AI systems.",
          "zh": "此举为AI训练中的数据治理建立了标准化机制，可能影响更广泛的行业知识产权和数据使用实践。它为网站运营者提供了更明确的方法来管理其内容被AI系统使用的方式。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/index/helping-websites-express-ai-training-preferences"
      },
      {
        "title": {
